Jacobian-lens evaluation suites (vendored)
==========================================

The six `lens-eval-*.json` prompt suites and `README.md` in this directory are
vendored VERBATIM from the Jacobian lens reference implementation:

    Project : jlens — Jacobian lens
    Source  : https://github.com/anthropics/jacobian-lens
    Commit  : 581d398 ("Initial release")
    Paper   : "Verbalizable Representations Form a Global Workspace in Language
              Models" — https://transformer-circuits.pub/2026/workspace/index.html
    License : Apache License, Version 2.0 (full text in ./LICENSE)

These files are the paper's §methods-comparison lens-quality evaluation prompts
(multihop, multilingual, order-ops, poetry, typo, association). Each `{slug}.json`
is prompts only: `items[*]` has `prompt` + `intermediates` (and, for
multihop/multilingual/order-ops, a `target` used ONLY to locate the readout
position — it is never scored). See `README.md` for the per-suite readout
position and the pass@k metric definition.

USAGE IN THIS REPO
------------------
`packages/browser/scripts/jlens/eval.mts` consumes these suites unmodified to
score the pilot Jacobian lens pack (J-lens vs logit-lens, normalized log-k
pass@k AUC). No file in this directory has been edited from the upstream copy.

ATTRIBUTION / DISCLAIMER
------------------------
All causal, swap/ablation, and tuned-lens results referenced by the paper were
produced by Anthropic on Anthropic's own models. The pass@k numbers computed in
this repo are a READOUT-ONLY partial reproduction on a 0.8B open hybrid model
(Qwen3.5-0.8B) and are NOT a reproduction of the paper's causal claims.

